WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:06.200
Lilith, leave this mansion and 
return to my place at once!

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:17.380
I came all this way to get you.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.960
It's good to see you again, Natsume.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:50.320
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:09.440
<b>Episode 9:   Complicated, Convoluted, Perplexing, Honest Feelings</b>

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:10.490
This is Nakashima Natsume-san,

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:13.390
my former classmate and former colleague.

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:15.150
Colleague...

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.290
Skip the introductions.

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:18.650
Just come home.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.400
Don't say that.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:23.770
My young master and I are both 
surprised, as this comes so suddenly.

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:25.990
I need a proper explanation.

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.880
I sent you a letter,

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.200
telling you to come back to my mansion.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:37.410
Did I not respond saying that I wouldn't return?

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:43.670
That's not good enough.

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:48.440
Your master's a child, and you 
aren't even receiving payment.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:54.480
I had heard rumors, but now that I see 
it in person, I'm even more perplexed.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.330
It's a dump. There's no one here.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:59.170
This mansion's got nothing but problems.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.560
Lilith, come home with me.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:03.370
No!

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.880
I'm the master of this mansion.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:09.130
And Lilith is my maid.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.220
Don't...

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.540
Please don't take her.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.910
<i>And that's not all.</i>

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:20.920
<i>I finally realized Lilith is special to me.</i>

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.970
<i>She hasn't even told me her feelings yet.</i>

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.850
Really, he's just a kid.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:37.030
How can a little runt like this be a master?

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:42.140
Whatever the reason, 
staying here won't do you any good.

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:46.580
You're way better off coming to my place.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:49.860
You realize that, too, don't you?

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:56.130
If she comes home, she gets paid well, 
and her master is a dependable adult.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.850
My mansion is way better than this place.

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:02.020
And it'll be good for her 
reputation as a maid.

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:07.060
Above all, she'll get to be with me.

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:11.060
I'm here because I chose to be.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:15.390
I've told you I won't 
go with you, haven't I?

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:20.750
No matter how many letters you 
send me, I won't change my mind.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.340
Lilith...

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:26.570
Thank you for coming all the way here.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.060
But please...

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.090
Why not?!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.880
I understand you way better than he does!

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:37.190
You've been on my mind all this time!
I reached out to you because I care about you!

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:40.580
Why are you choosing this flimsy 
little shrimp over me?!

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:47.340
<b>Shrimp</b>

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.770
<i>Shrimp...</i>

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.140
How rude!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.640
The young master is no shrimp.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.720
<b>Shrimp</b>

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:53.770
Let's see if this mansion and this 
kid are really good enough for you.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:59.730
I'm going to watch for a while to see if 
you're really cut out to be Lilith's master,

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.270
and what she likes so much about you.

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.820
First, education.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.540
Let's see if you have the knowledge 
and sensibility a master should have.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:21.840
Explain the theory of relativity to me.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.450
Sorry, I don't know.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.430
You don't even know the 
theory of relativity?!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.420
Do you, Natsume?

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.960
O-Of course I do.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:35.470
The relatives are, like, y'know, um, stuff.

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:36.650
That's the theory.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.570
That's impressive.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:44.030
I don't know about it yet, 
but I plan to study it.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.320
Yes. I'm sure you will, young master.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:58.360
Just because you're a bit studious doesn't 
mean you're qualified to be a master.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:01.080
What's more important is money.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.080
Money...

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.180
That's true.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.370
Right?

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:08.360
I don't have money.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.090
You're hopeless.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:13.940
A master has to be able 
to manage the finances.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.530
Manage...

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.590
Look at this.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.980
I've been saving up a little bit 
of my allowance each month.

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.680
That's peanuts.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.650
It's not enough yet,

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:34.260
but I hope to get Lilith a 
fantastic gift with it someday.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.490
Young master...

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.990
I-I have some spending money, too...

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:46.280
You did love shopping, Natsume.

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:48.920
I used to come with you all the time.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.980
I prefer to be called a prolific spender!

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:53.500
You don't understand anything!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.300
Natsume...

00:06:58.300 --> 00:06:59.300
Are you okay?

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.140
You should stay back.

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.820
There's glass everywhere.

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.240
I'll go get the broom.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.120
Thanks, Lilith.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.500
Are you hurt?

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.290
No.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.110
Thank goodness.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:19.080
Wh-What's wrong with you?!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.960
I just broke something of yours!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.330
Why would you be relieved?!

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:29.160
Isn't it normal to be relieved 
that no one's hurt?

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:30.690
B-But...

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:33.890
Besides, you're here to see Lilith.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.590
I want to treat you like a valued guest.

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:41.570
Y-You aren't fooling me.

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.470
Fooling you?

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:48.810
Lilith, this kid's deceiving you 
with his words, isn't he?

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:49.400
Huh?

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.590
You can't let your guard down 
just because he's a kid!

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:54.150
There's something wrong with 
this master and this mansion!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:57.210
I refuse to believe he's your master.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:57.860
Natsume,

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:02.620
please stop speaking ill of my master.

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:10.990
L-Lilith, I'm telling you this for your sake.

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:15.130
With all due respect, Natsume, 
that's what I don't understand.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:18.940
Why are you so fixated on me?

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:25.620
Even at the academy, you would 
approach me for every little thing.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:30.580
I've troubled you,

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:34.070
and of course, you've done 
things for my benefit, too.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:35.620
And you made me happy at times.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:38.500
And I'm grateful to you for it.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:44.400
But I'd like you to respect 
my will right now.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:50.710
I'm just looking out for your happiness.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:59.880
Everyone has their own way 
of expressing their feelings.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:05.080
Some people even act mean on purpose 
because they can't say they love someone.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.460
Why would they do that?

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:11.430
That's one of the mysteries of the human heart.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:17.450
Could it be that you love Lilith, Natsume?

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.160
Huh?!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.490
Wh-Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:26.320
Obviously not! That's obviously not it!

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.890
Are you sure?

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:32.260
You came all the way to this 
mansion for Lilith's sake.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:35.800
Whatever the reason, 
staying here won't do you any good.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:39.890
You've been on my mind all this time!
I reached out to you because I care about you!

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:44.380
I'm just looking out for your happiness.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.600
Isn't that because you love her?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.490
Wh-Wh-What...

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.800
I love Lilith.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.840
That's why I want her to stay here.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:56.620
What?!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:00.100
You're calling her home 
because you love her, too.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.510
Th-That's embarrassing!

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:03.690
How could you say such 
an embarrassing thing?!

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:07.610
Aren't you the least bit 
embarrassed, even for a child?!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:11.750
Is it embarrassing to express your feelings?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:21.900
It's embarrassing for people 
to know how you feel.

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:25.010
For a grown-up, it's something 
you have to hide.

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:26.760
Really?

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:29.700
But...

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:31.320
I'm in love with you.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.750
How will they know if you don't tell them?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:42.450
That's right.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.270
I love Lilith.

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:47.410
I can't help but think about her.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:49.780
I was worried about her.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:55.850
About what the mansion's like, 
what her master's like, what her life's like,

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:58.070
if she's happy...

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:02.040
That's why I came all this way!

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:10.610
Natsume, I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:12.560
Thank you.

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:14.520
Lilith...

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:17.440
But I still don't intend to go home with you.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:22.290
S-See? There's nothing good 
about saying how you feel!

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:23.910
You tricked me!

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:31.760
I'm off.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:35.220
Off you go, young master.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:40.880
Now...

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:56.830
Natsume?

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:59.540
You're a guest.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.440
You don't need to help.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:03.930
Yeah, but... I mean...

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:09.840
<i>Back at our mansion, there were 
several maids to do the cleaning.</i>

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:14.470
<i>We each had our own posts and specific duties.</i>

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.290
<i>We just needed to do what 
was assigned to us.</i>

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:19.660
<i>Fine.</i>

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:24.470
<i>Let's see what kind of brutal 
labor she's being forced to do.</i>

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:29.390
<i>It may be a small mansion, 
but there's a lot of area to cover.</i>

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.360
<i>It must be tough doing it all by herself.</i>

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:36.590
You don't have to help, Natsume. 
Please relax.

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:37.860
Fine.

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.430
Thank you for your work.

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:04.010
Shall we take a break?

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.170
I haven't done anything.

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:08.170
Aren't you miserable?

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.860
Working by yourself...

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:16.010
Isn't it stressful? Tiring? 
Don't you wish you could take a break?

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.200
Not at all.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.020
It's for the young master, after all.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.730
It's nothing.

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.170
<i>Lilith is a diligent person.</i>

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.190
<i>I guess the work itself 
isn't that hard for her.</i>

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.500
The young master should be coming home soon.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:32.910
I have to prepare.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.500
H-Hey...

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.370
You haven't rested at all.

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:41.250
<i>The real problem is...</i>

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.250
I'm home.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:44.640
<i>...him.</i>

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:47.150
Welcome home, young master.

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:51.210
You're drenched in sweat!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.060
Is it because you were...

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.070
Yeah.

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:56.010
I couldn't wait to see you again.

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.980
You didn't have to run all the way home.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.940
You must be tired.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:06.920
Actually...

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:12.230
I was thinking about you 
all day during class.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.380
About whether you were
tired out from cleaning.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:18.140
About what you might be up to right now.

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:23.400
I got so antsy, I couldn't help but run.

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:29.360
I love you today, too, Lilith.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:38.150
<i>This kid's putting Lilith on the spot 
with his embarrassing talk again.</i>

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:41.150
<i>No one would know what to say to that!</i>

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:44.690
<i>Especially when it's someone 
so much younger than her!</i>

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:01.050
<i>Isn't that right?</i>

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:11.460
Still, I worry that you might trip and 
hurt yourself, or get in an accident.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:15.690
Please walk home slowly so 
that I know you're safe.

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.710
Oh... Okay.

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.010
Hello again, Natsume.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.470
Welcome home.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.390
What's the matter, Natsume?

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.630
It's nothing.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.910
<i>That's the first time I've 
ever seen Lilith like that.</i>

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:44.960
Lilith, I'll help with dinner.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.900
Thank you.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:51.050
But I'm almost done already, 
so you don't need to worry about it.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:52.890
Okay.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.800
Are you really a maid, Natsume?

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:04.020
What?! Where did that come from?

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:08.780
Well, I can't picture you doing 
anything that's maid-like.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.190
I haven't seen it, either.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:13.930
And you're eating snacks before dinner.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.730
What do snacks have to do with anything?!

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:19.260
Don't you see my clothes?

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:22.330
I'm a maid, no matter how you look at it!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.810
Is it just for show, then?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.190
Who do you think you are, punk?!

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:30.880
I'll show you, then!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:31.710
Watch this!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.800
There's nothing to see here!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.210
You got a problem with me?!

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:48.660
As I said before, you're a guest, Natsume.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:50.880
Please let me take care of the chores.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:54.740
You don't have to force 
yourself if you can't do it.

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.190
I-It's not like I can't.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.370
S-Sorry, Lilith!

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:16.560
Are you all right?

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:19.040
I blew it again.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:22.490
Um, um... I need to get 
something to clean this up with.

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:29.310
Kind of nostalgic, don't you think?

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.760
Is it?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.270
Yes.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:35.420
Natsume was really bad at doing chores.

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:40.060
She would always mess up, 
and I would help her each time.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:01.800
Thanks to that, I've gotten 
good at doing chores.

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:05.530
W-Well, sorry!

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:07.700
I can do anything other than chores, though.

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:12.670
That aside, I think you two 
should take a shower.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:14.310
You're drenched.

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:16.700
You're right.

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:19.170
But we haven't cleaned up.

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:20.630
Worry about that later.

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:22.630
You'll smell bad if you stay soaked.

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:25.130
And you'll catch a cold.

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:30.700
Natsume, would you like 
to take a bath with me?

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.500
Just kidding.

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:33.260
What?!

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:34.880
Who would...

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:38.950
If you say so.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:43.680
How's the water?

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:45.680
It's fine.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:53.450
Natsume, I'm sorry for being 
so hard on you earlier.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:01.420
Please stop speaking ill of my master.

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:06.390
No, I was the one who... you know.

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:11.560
To be honest, I'm relieved that you came.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.440
It was a weight off my shoulders.

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:20.780
I think it helped me take my mind off things.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:28.400
I don't know how to respond to 
my young master's affection.

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:35.740
I never even imagined he would 
straight-up tell me he loves me.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:38.690
And from the young master I care so much for...

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:43.640
He hadn't expressed his feelings 
until around the time you arrived.

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:48.420
Up until then, he was only suspicious of me.

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:54.390
It's all so sudden, I...

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.260
I don't know how I feel.

00:19:58.110 --> 00:19:59.960
You don't, huh?

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:08.850
You may not have noticed it, 
but I figured it out.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.270
Figured what out?

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:18.010
I used to think he was a terrible master,

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:23.040
tying you down to this dull mansion 
and troubling you all the time.

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:27.280
The face you make when he keeps 
telling you he loves you...

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.970
You weren't troubled.

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.210
You seemed really happy.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:35.460
Happy?

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:36.630
Yeah.

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:38.930
Doesn't that mean...

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:42.900
No, that's not for me to say.

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:45.790
That's for you to realize for yourself.

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:54.300
Did I really look that happy?

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.040
Yeah.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.480
You were an open book.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:59.470
No...

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:01.410
Am I always that way?

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.380
I'm so embarrassed.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.990
<i>You looked so happy.</i>

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:12.610
<i>And you started smiling at me, too.</i>

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:18.210
<i>Somehow, that makes me happy, too.</i>

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:21.150
<i>I guess that's also thanks to that little runt.</i>

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.010
<i>Although I hate to admit it.</i>

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:24.630
You'll catch a cold.

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:38.450
What were you two talking about 
in the bath for so long?

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.740
Grown-up talk.

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:44.900
Wha?!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.950
<b>Next Time
Episode 10: For Whom Do the Stars Fall</b>
